.SS "\fBAttributes\fP withAppearance (\fBAttributes\fP overrides, boolean textOnly = \fRfalse\fP)"

.PP
Copy this drawing style with explicitly assigned appearance overrides\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIoverrides\fP An \fBAttributes\fP or \fBAnimatedAttributes\fP sample\&. Only channels explicitly set or scheduled on that source override this base\&. Setting a default value is explicit; for example, roundedCorners(0) removes a base style's rounded corners\&. 
.br
\fItextOnly\fP Defaults to false\&. True applies only text size, text style, font, fill opacity and blend mode, preserving the base foreground and other styling\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
An independent \fBAttributes\fP snapshot\&. Neither source changes, and this base's transform is preserved\&. Transform, location and size from overrides are not copied\&.
.RE
.PP
Appearance animation owns its channel when scheduled and contributes its current value; this method does not advance either source\&. MVC uses this to compose View appearance with the selected ControlAttributes state\&. Custom draw routines can use the same method\&. 
.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
API stability: 2 — Evolving\&. 
.RE
